<title>FRANCE: Suez-Lyonnaise, Saint-Gobain in pact.</title>
<headline>Suez-Lyonnaise, Saint-Gobain in pact.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CMF French markets council said on Monday it had been notified about a shareholders' pact between Suez Lyonnaise des Eaux and Saint-Gobain.</p>
<p>Saint-Gobain has four percent or Suez Lyonnaise and the latter has 6.5 percent of the glass-making group.</p>
<p>Under the terms of the agreement the two have the first right of refusal in the case one of the parties decides to sell. This right of first refusal does not apply on sales of no more than 0.5 percent of the capital over a 12-month period.</p>
</text>
